@startuml serialToI2CAppSequenceDiagram
participant "CAC" as cac
participant "SerialToI2CApp" as app
participant "I2cMasterDriver" as drv

== I2C Write (RID 0x0401) ==
cac -> app : SerialToI2CApp_Write(addr, pData, len)
app -> app : Validate initialized
app -> drv : I2cMasterDriver_Write(addr, pData, len)
drv --> app : OK
app --> cac : OK

== I2C Read (RID 0x0402) ==
cac -> app : SerialToI2CApp_Read(addr, pData, len)
app -> app : Validate initialized
app -> drv : I2cMasterDriver_Read(addr, pData, len)
drv --> app : OK + data
app --> cac : OK + pData filled

note over app
  CAC extracts addr and data from
  RID payload and passes as typed params.
  Read result is returned to CAC which
  builds the RoutineControl response.
end note
@enduml